   1957       
   1958       CO2REAER(KT,I)=CO2EX*(PCO2*KHCO2-CO2(KT,I))         !This computation is done in gas-transfer.f90: *BI(KT,I)/BH2(KT,I)
   1958    REAER in units of s-1
   1959       
   1960       TICSS(KT,I) = TICSS(KT,I)+CO2REAER(KT,I)
