   2004         SED(K,I)    = MAX(SED(K,I)+(SEDEM+SEDAS(K,I)+SEDCB(K,I)+SEDOMS(K,I)+SEDNS(K,I)-SEDD(K,I)-SEDBR(K,I))*DLT,0.0)   ! cb
   2004  11/30/06
   2005       else if(k == kb(i))then
